# Twelve functions over one environment: eight wait for the birth, four are defined behind it. The slots leave closures unmade, and a made closure does not fit such a slot by a typed store.
# The birth takes the run that stands directly behind it: all twelve are listed, none is made, nothing is stored.
# f1 = makeDial
# RUN: walk f1 mechanisms=all
# CHECK-LABEL: code f1:Body
# CHECK-COUNT-12: isMadeOnDemand
# CHECK: = NewObject {{*}}fields=[3, 6, 10, 4, 2, 8, 7, 0, 5, 9, 1, 11, 12]
# RUN(NEVER): walk f1 mechanisms=all
# NEVER-NOT: = PutSlot
# NEVER-NOT: = PropDefine
# RUN(PLAN): plan layouts mechanisms=all
